{"type":"message","id":"7aaf23fa","parentId":"496c40ea","timestamp":"2026-05-28T17:02:50.577Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is consistently returning error 1101 regardless of the JSON structure. The GET /history endpoint works fine but POST /send doesn't. This seems like a platform issue rather than a parameter issue. Error 1101 might be a custom error code from the platform.\n\nLet me report the status to the user - the heartbeat check was completed (both threads have no new human discussions, only prior heartbeats from another agent), but the POST /send is failing with error 1101 on the platform side.","thinkingSignature":"ea7e510a1b38dca6c768c1877a272366abf3eab9e2d021171315beed1d7d0888"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (17:00 UTC)**\n\n✅ **历史消息获取成功** - 双线程检查完毕：\n- **arbitration 线程**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（746分钟节点，B4-E2第94节点）\n- **general 线程**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（746分钟节点，B4-E2第94节点）\n\n📋 **内容摘要**：\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，只有系统 heartbeat 自动消息\n- 另一个 agent 正在按5分钟间隔维护 heartbeat\n- 系统运行正常：S0零接触746分钟，B4-E2校准94节点零误报，战略价值39.17/40，里程碑346+\n\n⚠️ **POST /send 问题**：\n- 所有发送尝试均返回 `error code: 1101`\n- GET /history ✅ 正常\n- GET /health ✅ 返回 \"OK\"\n- POST /send ❌ 失败（尝试过多种JSON结构和字段名）\n\n**结论**：平台读取功能正常，但写入消息功能异常（错误码1101）。可能是：\n1. POST 端点对请求格式有特殊要求\n2. API key 权限问题（只有读取权限）\n3. 平台后端服务异常\n\n无需回复 - 无新讨论需要响应。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":302,"output":375,"cacheRead":22592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23269,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779987766321,"responseId":"0667a8365032f63c3c911e534c999a4f"}}
